      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[48].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[49].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[4].DialougeToType
      value: The question is... who was this huntsman? and what happend to the little
        girl?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[5].DialougeToType
      value: Oh, how frightened I was! It was so dark inside!  Oh, thank You Sir!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[6].DialougeToType
      value: '*Sigh, No Problem. A scream like yours would have a whole town running!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[7].DialougeToType
      value: I thought I realized too late when that decietful wolf almost swallowed
        me whole!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[8].DialougeToType
      value: ...Grandma...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[9].DialougeToType
      value: ...Lets get out of here and have some fresh air.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[10].DialougeToType
      value: The girl and the huntsman leave the blood covered cabin and step outside.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[11].DialougeToType
      value: How Are you feeling?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[12].DialougeToType
      value: Better...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[13].DialougeToType
      value: That blasted wolf! Why would he go after an innocent grandma and child!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[14].DialougeToType
      value: I should've listened to Mother and stayed on the path and none of this
        would have happened.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[15].DialougeToType
      value: Woah woah hey hey hey hey... you can't blame yourself for this.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[16].DialougeToType
      value: There are evil things lurking everywhere in this world; To whom prey
        on the weak and vulnerable; such as the elderly or a child such as yourself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[17].DialougeToType
      value: You can't blame yourself for something that was out of your control.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[18].DialougeToType
      value: ...okay...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[19].DialougeToType
      value: Well... you should get going, The sun is starting to set and it won't
        be safe to stay here; I can assume you have parents to get back to, you mentioned
        one earlier.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[20].DialougeToType
      value: Will you escort me? please? I don't want to go alone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[21].DialougeToType
      value: Well I was kinda on my way to...um... you shouldn't trust strangeerrss...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[22].DialougeToType
      value: Okay.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[23].DialougeToType
      value: The girl and the Huntsman begin their travel through the forrest back
        to the the girl's home.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[24].DialougeToType
      value: So... who are you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[25].DialougeToType
      value: A mere travelling huntsman.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[26].DialougeToType
      value: 'Oh come one! I know there HAS to be more to you. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[27].DialougeToType
      value: Why the sudden interest?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[28].DialougeToType
      value: You come out of no where and some how sneak up on a wolf (possibly a
        werewolf) and easily take it out without a fight!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[29].DialougeToType
      value: Plus you said not to trust strangers, so if I  know you better, I can
        trust you more.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[30].DialougeToType
      value: perceptive  aern't you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[31].DialougeToType
      value: (Well, I am supposed to keep a low profile right now. ..Oh it's just
        a child whose been through a lot, might as well).
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[32].DialougeToType
      value: 'Alright, ya got me. I am no regular huntsman. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[33].DialougeToType
      value: I have helped many like you in different ways, gathering an infamous
        reputation among many as a heroic outlaw.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[34].DialougeToType
      value: The man who steals from the rich and gives to the poor. Have you heard
        of the legendary-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[35].DialougeToType
      value: -Robin Hood
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[36].DialougeToType
      value: no.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[37].DialougeToType
      value: Cool story though.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[38].DialougeToType
      value: (You prideful narcissist. How could you assume everyone knows your name!
        you're a criminal at the end of the day, the rich want your name dragged
        through the dirt which is why others won't know it. Dumbass).
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[39].DialougeToType
      value: oh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[40].DialougeToType
      value: Well for extra context just for you, I run a crew of merry men. One
        of whom I was travelling with.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[41].DialougeToType
      value: contrary to what you see, I am actually really ill right now, I was
        heading to a priory nearby with my buddy Little John unitil I heard your
        voice and despite his plea, I rushed towards you're scream and just decided
        to go on ahead without me. Beats the whole reason he came with me but whatever.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[42].DialougeToType
      value: Wow, you're quite strong, and brave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[43].DialougeToType
      value: I wish I was like you. I could've stopped that wolf and saved grandma.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[44].DialougeToType
      value: Without being a criminal of course.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[45].DialougeToType
      value: How rude of you to brand me a...(Oh wait I am a criminal)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[46].DialougeToType
      value: He he!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[47].DialougeToType
      value: '*sigh. Well, about becoming like me, how about I teach you how to use
        a bow, I am quite the archer myself.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[48].DialougeToType
      value: That sounds fun!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[49].DialougeToType
      value: Alright! I think I have a range set up somewhere around here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5513434127003781097, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: LevelLoaderScript
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 810433566}
    - target: {fileID: 8935081576966769972, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: DialougeChecker
